png", "id": "2663294627419731", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830822_2663294630753064_5353842829572621924_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-SYAqZ-inxUQ7kNvwFKDfyh&_nc_oc=AdoYnLPEtdNvFzdQPWkkTwxVMsuMr2HTjKi-dRbGbComRdQsV1SaQmDTi4NufGHXzEg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNpCrNsqUv2N3I-xQvQ0JLv5GY1HlRJzHMHwKmL0tHBjw&oe=6AE5F717"}, {"file_name": "05-alpha-options.png", "id": "1520356430140744", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825345_1520356433474077_4805466640865044655_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zTnwuh3gTS4Q7kNvwEbis4t&_nc_oc=Adoioqknkm7GXhPWU2Ihbs1odVJ35ZvoKEuCvNs6DHXHsMqCm4OwVMqOj73Q3cvngGg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOIe1LDq2hC6NnddpZjUmo0V5sgKtL8x2b2b3Yu3pRD9g&oe=6AE60B8A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "quest-store-trailer-thumbnail.png", "id": "1114629077791119", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830441_1114629081124452_4364447799683608141_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QVLB7zlcgjgQ7kNvwFFgks9&_nc_oc=Ado2zyW7UJvmmoygIT14XH3lYqktNhwF2-BLvI7NsWeZVHJvVGgEvT_vwATgIBpnuHg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOVNU6KHbaFlxPaQ7PfXb79ImWysv4juhi5wmEwqrbDRQ&oe=6AE5FBD0"}, "display_name": "Vistalyra: VR Video Player", "keywords": ["VR180", "passthrough", "3D", "VR360", "browser"], "long_description": "Your videos. Your cinema. Your VR browser.\n\nPlay local 2D, full/half SBS or over-under 3D, VR180/360 and supported fisheye videos. Auto detects recognized formats; manual modes, eye swap and one-eye viewing stay available. Save settings per video.\n\nBROWSE & WATCH\nSearch Google or enter an HTTPS address. Type in pages with the native keyboard and Search/Go/Enter. Watch compatible HTML video in flat, 180 or 360 mode with stereo layouts. Seek by timeline, buttons or stick when supported. Hide the dock; B/Y restores it. Immersive WebXR and DRM bypass are not supported.\n\nYOUR SPACE\nFlat or Curved screens; resize, zoom, move, tilt, rotate, recenter or head-lock. Choose Dark, Theater, Lounge or Beach, seat presets and height/position adjustments. Floating screens keep rooms upright. Use passthrough, compatible packed alpha or green/blue/black/gray keys with edge and spill controls.\n\nYOUR COLLECTION\nLocal files, direct streams and authenticated read-only WebDAV with Cancel/Retry. Search/sort, favorites, hide/restore, confirmed deletion, resume, bookmarks and next/previous playback.\n\nFINE CONTROL\nAudio/subtitle tracks, SRT/WebVTT files and subtitle styling. Speed, volume boost, frame stepping, repeat/A-B loop and sleep timer. Themes, clock/count widgets, optional click sounds, offline sample and visual first-run guide.\n\nBuy once: no ads or subscription. Bring your own lawful media. File, decoder, website and headset limits apply; third-party content is not included.", "short_description": "A personal Quest cinema and built-in VR browser for your own 2D, 3D and VR180/360 videos. Browse, search, play compatible web video in VR and keep compact controls nearby. Auto format detection, full manual options, floating/reclining screens, passthrough/alpha, WebDAV, subtitles and bookmarks. Choose your room, seat and theme, with optional ambience, room activities, hand visibility and movie cadence. Start with an offline sample and visual guide. One purchase; no ads or subscription."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://raheelswati.github.io/vistalyra-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Extrude Studio", "support_website_url": "https://raheelswati.github.io/vistalyra.html", "website_url": "https://raheelswati.github.io/vistalyra.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "con